      "name": "Nadia Vallejo",
      "time": "2026-08-15T20:33:32.890613",
      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "So typically for like a one bedroom apartment we see it takes like two and a half to three and a half hours to complete for two mover crew. I would say there's a potential, it might go a little bit on the higher end of that due to the elevator access at the load up, we do see like, elevators do take a little bit longer in terms of like the walk distance and whatnot. But with that being said, we have a two and a half hour minimum and then everything else after that gets billed in fifteen minute increments. So you do only pay for the time that gets using the day of. So the more prepared and ready you are on the day of and the easier it goes for the guys the less time it takes less money you spend at the end of the day.",
      "name": "Lukas Konrad",
      "time": "2026-08-15T20:33:33.941933",
      "type": "transcript",
      "user_id": "6549949337878528"
    },
